io=0 is separate from these actual requests.\n- Final readback proved 712 known CIDs stopped/PID0/noports/no-restart, 30 permissions false, six exact case/recovery profiles, 18 unchanged old budgets with complete mount sets and three new empty budgets. All 48 actual backup files remain: nine new, 36 old complete checkpoint files and three old partial-failure files. The old frozen summary field 27 remains unchanged; the full retained membership is explicitly verified.\n- Existing Outbox/Asynq, Commands, storage adapters and official MinIO APIs are reused. Isolated rehearsal Commands preserve old row multisets and append matching Cost/Audit/Evidence/Outbox facts; they do not stand in for real H1 trusted closure, H2 post-204 UNKNOWN or M1 mixed outcomes.\n- Independent source review passed with zero blockers: Python normal/-O each 66 methods and three focused Go packages. The author's five Go packages passed. Original pre-freeze attester failures are retained; both post-freeze attester modes then passed. Frozen packet/receipt/document review also passed with remaining_blockers=[] (34 review members and 808 independently reviewed external artifacts). The fixed complete entry then passed an explicit seven-index / 3,348-reference file-only final audit; its 1,017-member approval manifest is frozen. The first static CLI call used the wrong checker digest and was rejected before Docker/source I/O; that failure remains, and the corrected call used the unchanged allocation-bound binary.\n\nThe six future targets remain P2→T1→T2→H2A→M1A→M1B, max one per target and six globally, UNKNOWN never resent. P1 remains excluded; eleven survivors, all other environments/backups, old pins, new/old budgets and failure/UNKNOWN/provider-attempt/cost facts are retained. cleanup=0, hold-release=0, bypass=0. This preparation executed zero DELETE; all six source deletions and complete D1 remain NOT_RUN/NOT_ACCEPTED.\n\n[Complete exact proposal](https://github.com/qq550723504/data-product-platfor